This source distribution is based on openpi by Physical Intelligence:
https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi

The upstream Apache License 2.0 and bundled Gemma terms are retained in LICENSE
and LICENSE_GEMMA.txt. Copyright notices in inherited source files are preserved.

This distribution adds portable PiperX data conversion, training launch,
normalization, inference examples, checkpoint export and source-audit utilities.
It is not an official Physical Intelligence release and does not imply their
endorsement. Model weights and datasets are not included; their distribution and
use require independent review of the applicable licenses and permissions.
